      "id": 9765214683478,
      "title": "360° Sippy Cup - Leakproof 240ml Baby Training Cup (1-2 Years)",
      "body_html": "<h2>360° Leakproof Sippy Cup for Independent Drinking</h2>\n\n<p>The Magic Baby Cups feature a 360-degree drinking edge that allows your baby to sip from any angle without spills. Designed for babies aged 1-2 years, this training cup makes the transition from bottle to cup smooth and mess-free.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; float: none;\" alt=\"Magic Baby Learning Cup - Leakproof 240ml Drinkware for Easy Sips!\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/A_6a7b1eb3-f625-448e-a3e8-2743f4dc6f72.png?v=1756295964\"></p>\n\n<h2>Key Features</h2>\n\n<p><strong>360-Degree Drinking Design:</strong> The innovative rim allows your child to drink from any side of the cup, promoting natural drinking skills and oral development. No special spout required - just tilt and sip.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Leakproof Technology:</strong> The valve-activated system prevents spills and leaks, even when turned upside down. Your child can carry it around without creating messes on floors, furniture, or in diaper bags.</p>\n\n<p><strong>240ml Capacity:</strong> The perfectly sized 240ml capacity is ideal for small hands and provides enough liquid for snack time, meals, or on-the-go hydration. Not too heavy when full, making it easy for toddlers to hold independently.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"Magic Baby Learning Cup - Leakproof 240ml Drinkware for Easy Sips!\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/A2_aaf3c870-1af6-4246-8a0e-e36ec81f7366.png?v=1756295962\"></p>\n\n<h2>Supports Developmental Milestones</h2>\n\n<p>This baby training cup helps develop independent drinking skills while reducing dependency on bottles. The 360-degree design encourages proper oral motor development and helps prevent dental issues associated with traditional sippy cup spouts.</p>\n\n<h2>Versatile Use</h2>\n\n<p>Suitable for water, juice, or milk, this training cup works for various beverages throughout the day. Use it at home during meals, pack it in your diaper bag for outings, or send it to daycare for consistent drinking practice.</p>\n\n<h2>Perfect for Ages 1-2 Years</h2>\n\n<p>Specifically designed for babies and toddlers in the critical transition phase from bottle to cup. The easy-to-grip design and lightweight construction make it manageable for developing motor skills while building confidence in independent drinking.</p>",
