      "title": "Adorable Kawaii Bear Ceramic Bowl - Perfect for Fruits, Noodles, and Salads - Cute Korean Kitchen Tableware and Utensils",
      "body_html": "<div>\n<p><br></p>\n<div>\n<p>Introducing the Kawaii Bear Bowl Plate - a delightful addition to your kitchen that combines functionality with adorable design! Perfect for kids and the young at heart, this cute ceramic bowl is perfect for serving breakfast, salads, fruits, and more, making every meal a joyful experience.</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Highlights</p>\n<p>Experience the charm of our bear bowl and plate, crafted with high-quality ceramics that ensure durability and style.<br><br>Featuring a creative bear design, these pieces are not only easy to hold but also anti-scalding, making them safe for everyone.<br><br>With a comfortable texture and easy-to-clean surface, these bowls are ideal for everyday use.<br><br>Made from matte porcelain, please note that these items are not microwave or oven safe but are dishwasher friendly for effortless cleaning.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Specification</p>\n<p>Material: Ceramics<br><br>Size: Approximately 6 inches and 8 inches</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Notice</p>\n<p>- Don't forget to follow our store for exclusive discounts available only to our fans!<br><br>- Due to variations in measurement methods, please allow for slight size deviations. Color discrepancies may occur due to different monitor settings. Thank you for your understanding.<br><br>- We are committed to providing you with the best product and service. If you encounter any issues, please reach out to us, and we will resolve them promptly. Thank you for your support!</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Product Details</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: start;\">\n<img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Ha8eae47ad3f741b8bcdf12e509316faej.jpg\" alt=\"Adorable Kawaii Bear Ceramic Bowl - Perfect for Fruits, Noodles, and Salads - Cute Korean Kitchen Tableware and Utensils\" style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; float: none;\"><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H3c0dd4a250b548a9b5e299478bd7f32fJ.jpg\" alt=\"Adorable Kawaii Bear Ceramic Bowl - Perfect for Fruits, Noodles, and Salads - Cute Korean Kitchen Tableware and Utensils\" style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; float: none;\"><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hd207b231e8d84eb58521b36ffe5add310.jpg\" alt=\"Adorable Kawaii Bear Ceramic Bowl - Perfect for Fruits, Noodles, and Salads - Cute Korean Kitchen Tableware and Utensils\" style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; float: none;\"><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hb78b2df0f07347e4ad75cbd777f3dbb0X.jpg\" alt=\"Adorable Kawaii Bear Ceramic Bowl - Perfect for Fruits, Noodles, and Salads - Cute Korean Kitchen Tableware and Utensils\" style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; float: none;\"><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H24836d92a555461a83570064eae10a4cO.jpg\" alt=\"Adorable Kawaii Bear Ceramic Bowl - Perfect for Fruits, Noodles, and Salads - Cute Korean Kitchen Tableware and Utensils\" style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; float: none;\"><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hcdb3411139e24979b493dfa180d34521M.jpg\" alt=\"Adorable Kawaii Bear Ceramic Bowl - Perfect for Fruits, Noodles, and Salads - Cute Korean Kitchen Tableware and Utensils\" style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; float: none;\"><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H5326013e6ba541d78285d94b12fea827Z.jpg\" alt=\"Adorable Kawaii Bear Ceramic Bowl - Perfect for Fruits, Noodles, and Salads - Cute Korean Kitchen Tableware and Utensils\" style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; float: none;\"><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hc0b62ae4345f456695a7faa9b3d68a69l.jpg\" alt=\"Adorable Kawaii Bear Ceramic Bowl - Perfect for Fruits, Noodles, and Salads - Cute Korean Kitchen Tableware and Utensils\" style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; float: none;\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Package Contents</p>\n<p>1 x Bowl or Plate</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Notices</p>\n<p>1. We welcome both wholesale and drop shipping orders. You can place orders as needed, and we will strive to ship your products as quickly as possible.<br><br>2. Please note that buyers are responsible for any customs taxes that may apply. We are unable to cover customs charg